  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_3502.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El martes ha sido un d&iacute;a completamente taurino en las fiestas de verano de Ay&oacute;dar, con la prueba y embolada de un toro cerril de la ganader&iacute;a de Jos&eacute; Luis Pereda (La Dehesilla), y la embolada de una vaca y del toro cerril de la afamada ganader&iacute;a Jaralta.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3361.jpg\" alt=\"img_3361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3362.jpg\" alt=\"img_3362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3363.jpg\" alt=\"img_3363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3364.jpg\" alt=\"img_3364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3365.jpg\" alt=\"img_3365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3366.jpg\" alt=\"img_3366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3367.jpg\" alt=\"img_3367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3368.jpg\" alt=\"img_3368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/fiestasayodarmartes/img_3369.jpg\" alt=\"img_3369\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.de